{"id":"d9178a1638731beb","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-predicative-impredicative.md","title":"直谓性讨论中的算术理解限制","display":"df-predicative-impredicative — 直谓性讨论中的算术理解限制","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-predicative-impredicative","aliases":["91-df-predicative-impredicative","91-df-predicativity","91-df-impredicativity-truth"],"display":"df-predicative-impredicative — 直谓性讨论中的算术理解限制","depends_on":["[[91-df-ground-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-predicative-impredicative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-predicative-impredicative</span><span>91-df-predicativity</span><span>91-df-impredicativity-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-predicative-impredicative — 直谓性讨论中的算术理解限制"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_2\">\\(\\mathcal L_2\\)</span> 是基础语言加集合变量及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in X\">\\(n\\in X\\)</span> 的二类语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HasSetQuant}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{HasSetQuant}(\\varphi)\\)</span> 是公式语法树含集合量词的句法测试。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ArMatrix}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{ArMatrix}(\\varphi)\\)</span> 表示无集合量词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}_{\\mathrm{Ar}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}_{\\mathrm{Ar}}\\)</span> 为下述理解公理模式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VarOcc}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{VarOcc}(\\varphi)\\)</span> 为公式中出现的全部自由及受约束变量集，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\notin\\operatorname{VarOcc}(\\varphi)\">\\(X\\notin\\operatorname{VarOcc}(\\varphi)\\)</span>；可先重命名受约束变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}predicative\\text{-}impredicative}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{ArMatrix}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_2}\\land\\neg\\operatorname{HasSetQuant}(\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}predicative\\text{-}impredicative}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{ArMatrix}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_2}\\land\\neg\\operatorname{HasSetQuant}(\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}_{\\mathrm{Ar}}\\coloneqq\\{\\forall\\vec a\\,\\forall\\vec Y\\,\\exists X\\forall n\\,[n\\in X\\leftrightarrow\\varphi(n,\\vec a,\\vec Y)]:\\operatorname{ArMatrix}(\\varphi),\\ X\\notin\\operatorname{VarOcc}(\\varphi)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Comp}_{\\mathrm{Ar}}\\coloneqq\\{\\forall\\vec a\\,\\forall\\vec Y\\,\\exists X\\forall n\\,[n\\in X\\leftrightarrow\\varphi(n,\\vec a,\\vec Y)]:\\operatorname{ArMatrix}(\\varphi),\\ X\\notin\\operatorname{VarOcc}(\\varphi)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>predicativity 采用“直谓性”（亦称非预断性）的译名，避免与 predictivity 的“预测性”混淆。原稿把“定义量化某个含被定义对象的集合”直接当作通用充要定义，连已给自然数域的普通数值定义也会误判，现删除该判据及无来源哲学立场表。\n原书以 ACA 的算术理解为限定例子：矩阵不量化集合，允许自由集合参数；ACA 还含整个二类语言的归纳。最外层为待得集合写出的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists X\">\\(\\exists X\\)</span> 是理解公理结论的一部分，不能把它当作矩阵非直谓的证据。\n这一句法限制不提供所有数学定义或整个理论直谓性的充要判据，也不把“序数不超过 Γ_0”定义成直谓性。一般哲学分类仍需另定背景和构造原则。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 8.34 及其讨论，印刷页 94–95，PDF 页 105–106；§4 印刷页 28。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-language]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_2","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HasSetQuant}(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ArMatrix}(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}_{\\mathrm{Ar}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VarOcc}(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\notin\\operatorname{VarOcc}(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}predicative\\text{-}impredicative}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{ArMatrix}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_2}\\land\\neg\\operatorname{HasSetQuant}(\\varphi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}_{\\mathrm{Ar}}\\coloneqq\\{\\forall\\vec a\\,\\forall\\vec Y\\,\\exists X\\forall n\\,[n\\in X\\leftrightarrow\\varphi(n,\\vec a,\\vec Y)]:\\operatorname{ArMatrix}(\\varphi),\\ X\\notin\\operatorname{VarOcc}(\\varphi)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists X","display":false}],"bytes":2257,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-99","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-predicative-impredicative]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-72","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension